## ⚙️ Configuration

Everything goes through `.env` (git-ignored — see `.env.sample` for the full,
commented contract). The variables that matter at startup:

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `MODEL_TARGET` | `local` | Where models are stored: `local`{% if with_gcp %}, `gcs`{% endif %}{% if with_mlflow %}, `mlflow`{% endif %} |
| `DATA_SOURCE` | `demo` | Data source: `demo` (synthetic){% if with_gcp %} or `bigquery`{% endif %} |
| `DATA_SIZE` | `2000` | Size of the synthetic dataset (`1k`, `200k`, `all`…) |
{% if with_prefect %}| `MAE_THRESHOLD` | `3.0` | Quality bar below which a model gets promoted |
{% endif %}| `LOG_LEVEL` | `INFO` | Log verbosity: `DEBUG` adds the per-file chatter |
{% if with_gcp %}| `GCP_*`, `BUCKET_NAME` | — | Only needed for the cloud |
{% endif %}

**The defaults are enough to run everything locally.** No variable is mandatory
as long as you stay on `MODEL_TARGET=local` and `DATA_SOURCE=demo`.

