## 🔁 Continuous integration

`.github/workflows/` runs on every push:

| Workflow | Job | Checks |
|---|---|---|
| `ci.yml` | **Lint** | `ruff check` + `ruff format --check` |
| `ci.yml` | **Tests** | The tests, with no secrets (the `.env` is recreated from `.env.sample`) |
| `docker.yml` | **Docker** | The image builds **and** the API actually answers inside the container |

The Docker workflow is the only place where the `Dockerfile` is validated
automatically — handy when the container tier of the API tests is not run
locally.

